        <mxCell id="policy" value="Route policy for 10.253.2.0/24&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Hub preference: ASPath&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;CPE → Azure: private natural path; public +3 prepends&#xa;Azure → CPE: FRR local-pref private 200 / public 100&#xa;ECMP only within the same path class" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="625" y="340" width="350" height="145" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
